@Gideon Sato: The first report in #inc-vtg-hartford is your 10:42 AM message on 3 Aug. It says the gate kiosks were offline at the Hartford plant, both inbound lanes showed a white screen after badge scan, and the guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard.

Between 10:42 and kiosk 1 coming back at 11:03, the channel shows the guard doing manual check-in on the clipboard. At 11:03 Mateo reported that the guard checked in trailer 8836 and dispatch could see it.

The brain also has ticket SUP-5380 (Sev 1, opened 2026-08-03), with an update logged at 08:12 saying the reboot had failed and drivers were queueing. That is about two and a half hours before your message, so check whether it counts as an earlier report for the postmortem. I can't see who opened the ticket from what I have.
